('chem-atomic-molecular-mass-01','chemistry','physical-chemistry','Some basic concepts','Atomic and molecular masses','Using H=1 and O=16, the molecular mass of H₂O is:','["16 u","17 u","18 u","20 u"]',2,'H₂O has mass 2(1)+16=18 u.','foundation',array['jee-main','tg-eapcet','ap-eapcet'],'published','NCERT Chemistry XI; official JEE Main and EAPCET syllabi',now(),'codex-phase3-review','1.0'),
